{"parse": {"title": "12TH-12", "pageid": 127797, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-11\" title=\"12TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-13\" title=\"12TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.94.9F.E6.B4.BB.E4.B8.8E.E5.91.BD.E8.BF.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"生活与命运\">生活与命运</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 生活与命运</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Life and Fate</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>镰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>犁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>铸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>成<span class=\"color-value\"></span>剑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>锋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>令<span class=\"color-value\"></span>铁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>器<span class=\"color-value\"></span>学<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鞘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>势<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>让<span class=\"color-value\"></span>敌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>饿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>滋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>味<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11212</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不像生者那般会感受到痛苦，但痛苦很明显在他身上留下了烙印。他一定经历过难以想象的折磨。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>整个身体的结构都被破坏了，神秘术能量严重外泄，这进一步导致了虚弱……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎身躯的组合方式十分别扭，像一个人被粉碎了一千次，各个零件无法如常拼合到一起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>重塑之手怎么能做出这种事。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_qiushi2\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_qiushi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>为什么……他明明和这个地方毫无关系，为什么连卡戎也被……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_qiushi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_qiushi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔背向着卡戎站立，她缩起的肩膀正微微发颤。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan3\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我应该和你一起走的，卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和此地毫无瓜葛的朋友正躺在担架上。他总是沉默、自持，像一堵墙，静静伫立在所有人身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经历漫长旅途之后，梅蕾尔今天第一次见到了卡戎的神秘术——庞大，空洞，如同死亡本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>梅蕾尔……梅蕾尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-531715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>玛尔纱……我——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-3_3_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她本能地想回头，红发骑士的双手立刻扣在她的肩上，把她拧了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>别转身，我只是想提醒你打起精神，卡戎似乎想说些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>你……你想说什么，卡戎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……梅蕾尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>别、别说了，是我不好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仅仅一个词语，就让她的话如决堤河水，汹涌而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我们一起走了这么久，这么远，我害你和我一起东躲西藏，最后……最后遇到危险我就丢下你不管了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我要是再厉害一点，就能把你一起带走，或者从别人手上把你救回来，可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>可是……可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>是我太没有用了……对不起，是我害了你和安德烈森……对不起，我……你可能不会变成这样的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更多的话还没有说出口，它们全都一股脑地哽在她的喉咙里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……不，梅蕾尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎这才有机会重拾破碎的言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你答应过我，遇见危险就会逃走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>为什么你现在还……留在这里？为什么不去更远的……更安全的地方……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>但我……已经没办法逃跑了。不，我不应该逃走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>从、从最开始，我就不应该逃走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-531701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>如果我老老实实地归队，如果我没说要和你一起走……如果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>呜……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔又伤心得说不出话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有一双手拭去了她满面的泪水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你哭成这样，我还怎么指望你和我一起把卡戎治好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>别忘了我们要做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>卡戎不会有事的，只要意识的载体能够复原，他应该就能慢慢恢复过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>现在只有我能面对卡戎，而我需要一个信得过的助手，也就是说，这里能帮他的只有我们两个了，明白了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-531720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>对……没错，我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>那么，休息一下，擦擦眼泪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>整个过程不会很轻松，但很快就会结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>听我的指令，我要什么东西就立刻递给我，能做到吗，梅蕾尔？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少年踩在倒塌的石柱上，身后是插在修道院房顶的轰炸机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞机被击落了，但它的身子依然耀武扬威，时刻提醒着这座城市有多么脆弱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>别列格勒不能成为牺牲品！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民们：</div><div>别列格勒不能成为牺牲品！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许多人围着费奥多尔·彼得罗维奇，彼此紧挨着，成了一个紧密的圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>保护别列格勒！交出伊戈尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民们：</div><div>交出伊戈尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不断有零星的人靠近他们，成为圈的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剩下的居民在不远的地方看着，没有加入示威的圆环。有人掩面私语，有人抬起头，忧心忡忡地看着即将落下炸弹的天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>示威的市民翻越街巷上堆砌的障碍物，终于在城防指挥部前的街垒前被黑洞洞的枪口拦下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>别往前走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>滚开，你这胡子还没长齐的小毛孩。我要和你们的军长说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>你要说就在这儿说，我给你传话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谢尔盖察觉到身侧有人推了他一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">民兵：</div><div>我认得这人，小子，我来和他说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>别列格勒民兵攀上街垒，好站得更高些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">民兵：</div><div>费奥多尔，带着你的人滚回去吧！还是说，你就是要来给我们添乱的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>迪马，你怎么还和骑兵军站在一起？我告诉你吧，民兵团有好多人都站在我们这边了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">民兵：</div><div>他们就是一些没断奶的羊，被人一声吼就吓得四脚朝天了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>真是说不通道理——只要把那个叫伊戈尔的人交出去，格鲁托夫就不烧咱们的城。为什么不做这个买卖呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>你这城里人，白痴，土匪的话也听！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>那你又知道这伊戈尔是什么玩意？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>顿河上下有谁认识伊戈尔？把他送出去又有什么坏处？骑兵军说要守城，那把伊戈尔交出去，这事不就完了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">市民代表：</div><div>伊戈尔和格鲁托夫有恩怨，就让他们自己到草原上解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>你什么都搞不明白，大叔，我一看你这鼻子，就知道你早就把自己的脑子喝坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>别在这里废话了，我听着都头疼。这事要怎么做，难道还是你说了算呀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群爆发出一阵嘈杂的、无法辨认内容的嘘声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">民兵：</div><div>有这股热情劲儿，倒是带你们的人去把土匪占着的鱼市场夺回来啊！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长收回了投向窗外的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>告诉一营营长，让他带上几个机灵点儿的兵去疏散堵在外面的市民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>记住，别擦枪走火了。费奥多尔不敢真的动手，他还要留着命享受家里数不完的钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃带着命令离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>格鲁托夫不愧是你的人，伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这离间的计策老套但有效，我们的士兵不擅长巷战，保卫别列格勒需要依靠民兵团和市民的配合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>格鲁托夫把你的名字抛出来后，至少有一半人失去了对我们的信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>他会用一切方法让我死得更狼狈一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>为什么格鲁托夫这么执着地要你的命？我以前确实和他处不来，看不出他这么恨你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔沉默半晌，像是要在一处黑暗的深潭中捞取思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>他和我一样，在圣保罗之后都无法再回头，只能在认定的路上走下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>与重塑之手达成一次性的交易之后，他怨恨我给的不够多，不值得他与我一同做出那些所谓“正确的牺牲”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>格鲁托夫认为脱离重塑之手是一个巨大的错误，他希望从他们身上攫取更多力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不过，我承诺给他的从来都不是力量，而是生存。但他仍然不明白，以为“奇迹”是能让他接近神明的圣物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>格鲁托夫把这种观念不合当成是我的软弱，执着于向我证明他的道路才称得上正确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……他一直都想杀死我，夺走我向重塑之手换来的“奇迹”，或者是向重塑之手证明自己的价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>所以，我们可以利用这种“执着”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗外的街道上，已经传来骑兵军与市民发生争执的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>有一点是没错的，决定性的战斗会在郊外发生。我们不能在城内久留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>一起出城吧，伊万。我们最好在回营地的路上就找到击败格鲁托夫的办法。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-12"}}